---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Gosub - Organic Web Engine</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style lang="scss">
      :root {
        --sage: #C3D3C4;
        --forest: #2C4A3B;
        --sand: #F5F1E7;
        --clay: #D4A373;
        --text: #1A2E24;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      
      body {
        background-color: var(--sand);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.8;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .gradient-bg {
        position: fixed;
        top: -50%;
        left: -50%;
        width: 200vw;
        height: 200vh;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--sage) 0%, transparent 40%),
                    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.3) 0%, transparent 30%);
        filter: blur(100px);
        z-index: -1;
        animation: breath 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      }

      @keyframes breath {
        0% { transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0); }
        100% { transform: scale(1.1) translate(-2%, 2%); }
      }

      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 3rem 5rem;
        
        .logo {
          font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          font-weight: 300;
          letter-spacing: 2px;
          color: var(--forest);
        }

        nav a {
          font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
          color: var(--forest);
          text-decoration: none;
          margin-left: 3rem;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
          letter-spacing: 1px;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          position: relative;
          
          &::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px; left: 0;
            width: 0; height: 1px;
            background: var(--clay);
            transition: width 0.4s ease;
          }

          &:hover::after { width: 100%; }
        }
      }

      main { padding: 0 5rem; }

      .hero {
        margin: 10vh 0;
        max-width: 900px;

        h1 {
          font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
          font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
          font-weight: 300;
          line-height: 1.1;
          color: var(--forest);
          margin-bottom: 2rem;

          i {
            color: var(--clay);
            font-style: italic;
          }
        }

        p {
          font-size: 1.2rem;
          max-width: 500px;
          color: rgba(26, 46, 36, 0.8);
        }
      }

      .modules {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 5rem;
        margin: 15rem 0;

        .module {
          background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
          backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
          border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
          padding: 4rem;
          border-radius: 40px 0 40px 0;
          transition: all 0.5s ease;

          &:hover {
            border-radius: 0 40px 0 40px;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
          }

          h3 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--forest);
          }
        }
      }

      .cta-section {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 10rem 0;
        padding: 8rem 0;
        position: relative;

        &::before {
          content: '';
          position: absolute;
          top: 0; left: 50%;
          transform: translateX(-50%);
          width: 1px; height: 5rem;
          background: var(--forest);
        }

        h2 {
          font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
          font-size: 4rem;
          font-weight: 300;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
          display: inline-block;
          padding: 1rem 3rem;
          border: 1px solid var(--forest);
          color: var(--forest);
          text-decoration: none;
          font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
          letter-spacing: 2px;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          border-radius: 30px;
          transition: all 0.4s ease;

          &:hover {
            background: var(--forest);
            color: var(--sand);
          }
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="gradient-bg"></div>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">Gosub</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
        <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
        <a href="#github">Github</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>A browser engine <i>cultivated</i> from scratch.</h1>
        <p>Gosub is a modular browser engine written in Rust. No corporate agenda. Just pure, composable technology designed to let you build the web experience you envision.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="modules">
        <div class="module">
          <h3>True Modularity</h3>
          <p>Trait-based architecture allows you to seamlessly swap out the JavaScript engine, rendering backend, or layout system without forking. It is entirely yours to shape.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="module">
          <h3>Written in Rust</h3>
          <p>Memory safety, concurrency, and performance. Gosub isn't a wrapper around existing massive codebases; it's a completely new, healthy root system for the web.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-section">
        <h2>Grow with us.</h2>
        <a href="#" class="btn">Join the Community</a>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
